 "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": [{"content": "<span class=\"italic\">\"Astrology\"</span> is the study of celestial bodies interpreted as having an influence on human affairs and the natural world.", "type": "text", "tip_id": 0}], "type": "tips"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: <span class=\"bullet\">Listen to the audio.</span> <span class=\"bullet\">Type in the missing words. </span><span class=\"bullet\">Use capital letters where necessary.</span>   ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You have 2 attempts to submit your answers.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}]}], "type": "TYP", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 4, "stimuli_ids": [2], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_3", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "Title:", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_3", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 1}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "Paragraph:", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_3", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 2}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Now, it's time to write a persuasive paragraph. </span>\n<br/><span class=\"italic\">Instructions:<br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Write a 150-170 word persuasive paragraph about technology, coincidences or astrology.</span><br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Before you begin, write down at least three positive points, and two negative points for your argument.</span><br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Start your paragraph by making a statement about the overall situation.</span><br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Dedicate the first part of the paragraph to the side with which you agree.</span><br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Then include the other side of the argument.</span><br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">The final part of the paragraph should summarize both paragraphs, and provide your own general opinion on the matter.</span><br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Use linking words like also, indeed, furthermore, in fact.</span><br/></br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you have typed in ALL your answers, click the <span class=\"strong\">Go to Writing Task</span> button.\n</span><br/><br/>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "My Persuasive Paragraph", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Activity 3", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "You are done!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Time to review your persuasive paragraph.</span><br/>\nDid you include the following in your paragraph?<br/>\n<ul><li>Linking words</li><li>A general statement to start the paragraph</li><li>Both your own and the opposing point of view</li></ul>\nRead your paragraph to a partner.<br/>\nProofread your paragraph for grammar, spelling and punctuation errors.<br/>\nCli