ence that cannot be fully explained. On the other hand, skeptics of this phenomenon are unable to provide a plausible alternative explanation.\n<br/> <br/>\nDue to the unreliability of anything related to technology, gadgets or timing,  it is a bad time to start new projects, travel, or do anything new that could fall apart later. Similarly, it is advised that people hold off on making important decisions during this unstable period. With this in mind, some may ask how to survive Mercury retrograde. The answer is - to sit back, relax.", "id": 2, "time": "37700", "image": "engenn10le17ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Think twice about your actions and movements. Furthermore, take care of anything that requires re-evaluation and revision. And for the 55-69% of Americans who don't think that astrology is credible, just remember: the planet Mercury will continue to exert its influence, whether you believe it or not.", "id": 3, "time": "87000", "image": "engenn10le17ob08re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn10le17ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le17ob08re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "Persuasive Paragraph", "id": 1, "time": "5000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class = \"bullet\">What is a persuasive paragraph?</span>", "id": 2, "time": "7000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class = \"bullet\">Planning a persuasive paragraph</span>", "id": 3, "time": "26000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class = \"bullet\">Writing a persuasive paragraph</span>", "id": 4, "time": "41000", "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn10le17ob08re3vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "_data": [], "type": "video", "template_override": 1}]}]}